{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13121","headline":"杂言湖山歌送许鸣谦 · 皇甫冉","name":"杂言湖山歌送许鸣谦","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湖中之山兮波上青，桂飒飒兮雨冥冥。\n君归兮春早，满山兮碧草。\n晨舂暮汲兮心何求，涧户岩扉兮身自老。\n东岭西峰兮同白云，鸡鸣犬吠兮时相闻。\n幽芳媚景兮当嘉月，践石扪萝兮恣超忽。\n空山寂寂兮颍阳人，旦夕孤云随一身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13121.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13121","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}